translate es strings:

    # game/scripts/Locations/Shower.rpy:1534
    old "You step inside and see %s. She freezes, water still running down her body."
    new "Entras y ves a %s. Se queda paralizada, con el agua todavía corriendo por su cuerpo."

    # game/scripts/Locations/Shower.rpy:1534
    old "You walk in and find %s mid-shower. Her eyes snap to you immediately."
    new "Entras y encuentras a %s en plena ducha. Sus ojos se clavan en ti de inmediato."

    # game/scripts/Locations/Shower.rpy:1534
    old "%s is standing under the water. She notices you and her breath catches for a moment."
    new "%s está de pie bajo el agua. Te nota y se le corta la respiración por un momento."

translate es strings:

    old "She grabs a towel and wraps it around herself without hurrying, never once taking her eyes off you."
    new "Ella toma una toalla y se envuelve sin apuro, sin apartar los ojos de ti ni un momento."

    old "She pulls her towel tighter. Her eyes never leave you."
    new "Ella aprieta la toalla. Sus ojos no se apartan de ti."

    old "Sorry. I didn't know you were in here."
    new "Perdona. No sabía que estabas aquí."

    old "I'm not going to apologize."
    new "No voy a disculparme."

    old "Relax. It's just a body."
    new "Relájate. Es solo un cuerpo."

    old "She takes her time reaching for the towel. She decides exactly when you've seen enough."
    new "Se toma su tiempo para alcanzar la toalla. Ella decide exactamente cuándo ya viste suficiente."

    old "She doesn't tighten her towel. She just raises an eyebrow and waits."
    new "No aprieta la toalla. Solo levanta una ceja y espera."

    old "Sorry. I'll give you some privacy."
    new "Perdona. Te doy privacidad."

    old "I'm staying right here."
    new "Me quedo aquí."

    old "Don't cover up on my account."
    new "No te cubras por mi culpa."

    old "She doesn't cover herself. She just watches you watching her."
    new "No se cubre. Solo te observa mientras la miras."

    old "Her hand rests on the knot of her towel. She doesn't tighten it."
    new "Su mano descansa sobre el nudo de la toalla. No lo aprieta."

    old "You're beautiful, you know that?"
    new "Eres hermosa, ¿lo sabías?"

    old "Leave the towel. Let me look at you."
    new "Deja la toalla. Déjame mirarte."

    old "Anyone could walk in on us like this."
    new "Cualquiera podría entrar y vernos así."

    old "She smiles when she sees it's you, and doesn't reach for the towel at all."
    new "Sonríe cuando ve que eres tú, y ni intenta tomar la toalla."

    old "She smiles when she sees it's you, and her fingers find the knot of her towel."
    new "Sonríe cuando ve que eres tú, y sus dedos encuentran el nudo de la toalla."

    old "You look incredible."
    new "Te ves increíble."

    old "Turn around. Slowly."
    new "Date la vuelta. Despacio."

    old "Leave the door open."
    new "Deja la puerta abierta."

